Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃里克郡 康普顿-怀内特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}COMPTON WYNATES WARWICKSBIRE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉爵士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir william…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉爵士 您怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}sir william! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找医生来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and fetch the physician! Go and get him! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天 为何没人叫醒他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god, man: Why did no one wake him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种情况下 睡眠是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep in these cases is fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 走开 蠢人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away! Keep away, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们主子得了汗热病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master has the sweating sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你俩… 你 留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two… you stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得试试救救他… 可怜人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must try and treat him… poor fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他翻身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行行好 你们就忍着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of god, get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许还有救\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may yet save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要刺入他的背部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to cut into his back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我听说这方法有时有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I heard that it sometimes works,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能让毒素流出体外\N{\fnArial\fs30}it draws off some of the toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能见他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I not meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 女人… 出去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, woman. Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下及安-博林女士到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty the king and lady anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安女士 衷心欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress anne. You are most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢主教阁下 送给我如此精美的胸针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must thank your eminence for the magnificent brooch you sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢就太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是意大利风格的 我认为它的工艺实在高超\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is italianate, I thought the craftsmanship superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信陛下也会同样开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure your majesty will be equally pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能收到法兰西国王的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the presents sent by the king of france:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只黄金圣杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A golden chalice!|能收到法兰西国王的礼物|with the presents sent by the king of france:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只黄金圣杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A golden chalice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金丝编织的布料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold silk altar cloths!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有价值至少3万达克特的织锦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tapestries worth, I'm sure at least 30, 000 ducats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我们便与法国再次结盟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are once more allies with the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 并且英法两国 都正式对罗马皇帝宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed. And we are both officially at war with the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. It pleases me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝他肯定也很满意 因为他宣告天下他刚得了个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it pleased the emperor to announce that he has just had a son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是他抛弃我女儿另娶的 那个公主所生\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the princess he jilted my daughter for!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会有儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这虾怎么样 安女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the shrimp, lady anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常美味 阁下 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect, your eminence. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您太慷慨了 任何方面都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are too generous. In everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那 我们的私事如何了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what of our personal matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我已安排派出两位同僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, I have arranged to send 2 of my colleagues,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位年轻律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 young lawyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯蒂·加德纳 我的秘书 及爱德华·福克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}stephen gardiner, my secretary, and edward foxe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前去罗马附近的奥维多会见教皇 他现在居住在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meet the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老人家显然还在经受不幸的病痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in wretched discomfort, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您给这两位律师什么任务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you have these lawyers do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会给教皇陛下强调 配合我们的必要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady, they will press upon his holiness, the necessity of his cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须让他意识到 无论从民法还是教规来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must recognize, in both civil and canon laws,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您的婚姻都是无效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the invalidity of your majesty's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.11,0:05:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为这事阅读了无数条文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have read countless texts on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时看到深夜 令到自己头痛不已…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes reading well into the night and giving myself terrible headaches…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我比任何时候都确信我的案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am more assured now than ever of the spiritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}符合教会信条以及法律公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}land egal justice of my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的道德良知非常清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}My conscience is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您可以放心 这两位绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your majesty must rest assured, that these 2 gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两位永不停歇的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}these 2 restless lawyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在得到满意答复前不会离开奥维多\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not leave orvieto until they have attained satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来你和国王有过交谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}HAVE YOU SPOKEN RECETLY WITH THE KING?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}NO, YOUR MAJESTY.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西主教拒绝我的求见 并且十分高姿态\N{\fnArial\fs30}CARDINAL WOLSEY REFUSES MY REPUWSTS, AND IN A MOST HIGH HANDED MANNER…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道英国人有个特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}IT IS SOMETHING I HAVE LEARNED ABOUT THE ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小小得意就能让他们飞扬跋扈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A SMALL ADVANTAGE MAKES THEM OVERBEARING,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微不足道的难事也能让他们彻底沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}WHILE THE SLIGHTEST ADVERSITY MAKES THEM DESPONGDENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到一封您侄儿 皇帝陛下的密信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I HAVE RECEIBED A CODED LETTER FROM YOUR NEPHEW, THE EMPEROR.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他表示 在这丑恶的事件中 必将给您最坚定的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}HE DECLARES HIS UNDYING SUPPORT FOR YOU IN THIS UGLY MATTER.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你们不用跟来了 - 是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You may wait for me year. - Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}PRAY CONTINUE.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下已致信克莱门特教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}HE HAS ALREADY WRITTEN A LETTER TO HIS HOLINESS POPE CLEMENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提醒他英国王的野蛮意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}WARNING HIM OF THE KINGS BRUTAL INTENTIONS.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并要求教皇取消沃尔西的继任权\N{\fnArial\fs30}HE HAS ASKED CLEMENT TO DISMISS WOLSEY AS OFFICIAL LEGATE,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宣布您和国王的婚姻是合法有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}AND DECLARE YOU AND THE KING LEGALLY MARRIDE.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下请您务必坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}HE TELLS YOU TO BE STRONG.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I TRY TO BE.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我能知道得太少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}BUT SO MUCH NOW IS HIDDEN FROM ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请转告他 我信任他胜过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}TELL HIM THAT I TRUST IN HIM MORE THAN ANYONE ELSE.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}EXCEPT IN GOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑斯廷斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress hastings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}林纳克医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Linacre?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下一听到消息马上就派了我来 但很遗憾 还是没来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as he heard the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑斯廷斯女士 我知道您是他的合法妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress hastings I know you were his commonlaw wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他无论何时何地 都是一位非常可爱及有爱心的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in every way, a most lovely and loving man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下会万分想念他的陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty will miss his companionship a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有极大的危险 程度之严重我们无法预测\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a grave risk. About which we know so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可怜的 甜蜜的亲爱的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My poor, sweet darling…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 您一定要焚烧掉 他所有的寝具和衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. You must burn all his bedding and clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在首要的 是尽快给他下葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be in the ground first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 这是国王给教皇的一封私人信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, here is a personal letter from the king to the pope,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提前感谢他 带着同情心出席国王的诉讼\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanking him in advance for attending to his suit sympathetically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇陛下有可能如何回应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is his holiness likely to respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向你实说 加德纳先生 我也不能完全肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest with you, mr. Gardiner, I am not absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇曾被罗马皇帝雇佣兵施以暴行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope was an abused prisoner of the emperor's mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此 皇帝仍让他逃到了奥维多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even though the emperor reputedly allowed him to escape to orvieto,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那儿 虽然他的状况略有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}his condition continues to be little better there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他生活还是比较悲惨 被锁在一座残破的城堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leads a most sad life, locked up in a ruined castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种情况下 教皇为什么会偏向\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, why should the pope favour the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个让他悲惨不堪的圣罗马皇帝 而不向从未伤害于他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has caused him nothing but misery over the king of england,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国国王靠拢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has never caused him any harm at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是 主教阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trouble is, your eminence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰国王的势力比罗马皇帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the swords of the king of england are much further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要遥远许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the swords of the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外交事宜几乎从来都是 以地域距离决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diplomacy is nearly always settled by such proximity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确是律师之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken like a true lawyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一所有说法都不奏效 就用威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if all else fails, use threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉教皇陛下 如果我国王 无法从教廷得到满意决断…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell his holiness that if the king can't get satisfaction from the papal court…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:10:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会找到其他办法达到目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will find other means to satisfy his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让自己从现在的妻子身边解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rid himself of his present wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说得够明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 阁下 我们懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, eminence. We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快行动吧 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God speed, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉去世那晚 仆人们开始偷他的遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evening after william died, his servants began stealing his effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在遗嘱里写了要把这个遗赠予国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his will he bequeathed this to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总算保住了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉葬在墓园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}William is buried in the churchyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那两位可怜的仆人 他们也染了病\N{\fnArial\fs30}So too are the poor servants who also caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在之后24小时内也死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and died of the sweat in the last 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道要跟您说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉-康普顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}WM COMPTON.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺福克大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教阁下 - 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eminence. - Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有何贵干？- 跟您说几句 如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - A word with you if I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 私下说 - 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In private. - Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您被命令 立刻回您东英吉利亚的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are commanded to return at once to your estates in east anglia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？谁的命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? And by whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}By his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲笔写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下希望您能监管粮食生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty would like you to supervise grain production.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和北海贸易\N{\fnArial\fs30}and north sea trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贸易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贸易…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trade…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当我是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屠夫的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A butcher's son?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您也看到了 大人 这并非我的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you see, my lord, these are not my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor william!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是他一生所有的遗物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this all that remains, of an entire life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要确保这些珠宝 全数归还他不幸的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must see that these jewels get back to his unfortunate lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉是在他沃里克的家中死去的 离这里很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}William died at his house at warwickshire which is a long way from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑这恶疾不要扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}and god willing, the disease won't spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你们在任何情况下 都要增强自己的抵抗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should fortify yourselves against it in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.73,0:14:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些是医治溃疡的膏药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, these are plasters to heal ulcers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是种软膏 能清凉灼伤皮肤 还能止痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an unguent, which cools inflammation and stops itching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个帮助消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}This helps digestion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个润滑干燥皮肤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}this soothes dry skin…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这种软膏 能缓解阳具疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this ointment will comfort your cock if it's sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些叫做瑞西斯药片\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are called pills of rasis,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是用发明它的土耳其人的名字命名\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're named after the turk who invented them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说能对付热汗病\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are said to be good against the sweating sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这种草药汤剂更有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this infusion is even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是草药混合液 有金盏花\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mixture of marigold,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和效用很好的草药\N{\fnArial\fs30}manus christi a very efficacious herb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}酢浆草 牧草\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorrel, meadow plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚麻籽醋 象牙屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}linseed vinegar, ivory scrapings,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部跟糖混合 试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}all mixed with sugar. Take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人告诉过我 喝草药汤剂是最不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone told me that taking infusions was the worst thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会让你有些反胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make you feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但比起它预防的疾病还是好太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's better than the sickness it prevents!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 黑斯廷斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mistress hastings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她葬在威廉爵士旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury her beside sir william.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真动听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是一段写给朋友的篇章\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just something for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 我无法工作 除非我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, I can't work, unless I'M…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 晚安 托马斯-塔利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course. Good night, thomas tallis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的名字是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请留一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么… 是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why… me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为在世人眼中 你们两个是一模一样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the world judges you both the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:16:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 看起来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Well, it seems to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得 我看到你俩的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don'T. I see the differences between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看向你 见到了你头上的一道光\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I looked at you, I saw a light around your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一道光？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A light?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是说… 像光环一样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean… like a halo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 像一圈光环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Like a circle of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! You're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以吻你吗 琼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I kiss you, joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 内务大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, chamberlain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 允许我介绍让-伯雷殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, may I present his highness jean de bellay,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜恩的主教 新任法国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}bishop of bayenne, the new french ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bienvenue monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Votre majest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我很高兴地向您递交国书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I am happy to present my credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴再次跟你国君结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am happy to be once more friend and ally to your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢他珍贵的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank him for his precious gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}ITS A PLEASURE YOUR HIGHNESS.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 阁下 对罗马皇帝之战如何了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your excellence, how is the war against the emperor going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下不必焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty has no cause for anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国军队和我们的盟友热那亚的舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}A french army and a fleet of our allies the genoese.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经毫不留情的将罗马皇帝的军队困在那波利\N{\fnArial\fs30}have hopelessly besieged the emperor's soldiers at napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早晚查尔斯将会投降 并撤离意大利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, charles must surrender, and leave italy altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的是绝好的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is truly excellent news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 阁下 让我向你介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Your excellence, allow me to introduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是安小姐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this not mademoiselle anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很荣幸见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西阁下 跟我讲过你的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eminence, cardinal wolsey, has told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他没告诉我你是如此的美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did not tell me how beautiful you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为一个法国人 这可是何等罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a frenchman, that is almost a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是法国人对所有的女人说她们美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}BUT FRENCHMEN TELL EVERY WOMAN SHE IS A BEATIFUL.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是罪过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}IS THAT NOT A CRIME TOO?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给您准备了份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I HAVE S GIFT FOR YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}FOR ME?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对是送给您的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}FOR YOU SIR.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只狗动作迅猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}THIS DOG IS VERY FAST.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常的出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}…REALLY FORMIDABLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会欣喜的 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to be glad, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下大人刚刚告诉我 罗马皇帝很快将会被\N{\fnArial\fs30}His excellence has just informed me that the emperor is soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.89,0:19:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}击败 并被逐出意大利\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be defeated and driven out of italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将不会成为我们幸福的阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll no longer be able to stand in the way of our happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回去找你妻子去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？居然对国王出言不逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? In the name of the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是有人说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did someone say something…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这阵臭味是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that stink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是醋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vinegar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是醋 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vinegar, excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 城内爆发了汗热病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, there's been an outbreak of sweating sickness in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今日 已有300人丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 deaths, this day alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传林纳克医生 快 我的妻子呢？皇后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch dr. Linacre. Quickly. What about my wife, the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后怎样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安 别怕 我很快会见到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne! Don't be afraid, I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治 带你妹妹去她的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, take your sister to her chambers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allez, allez!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 从我的经验看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find from experience, your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多情况下 在实际病症出现之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}that in a great many cases before any actual physical symptoms appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}患者都会饱受精神错乱之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sufferers undergo a curious mental disorientation,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快产生恐惧和担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}a quick sense of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是病痛和死亡的前兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}a foreboding of pain and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次幻觉都在扰乱人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every rumour sends them into agitated alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确切的说 每个幻觉都能让人们大量出汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed one rumour can itself cause a 1000 cases of sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以成千上万并非靠苦力出汗的人 也因恐惧而染上此病\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thousands catch the disease from fear who need not otherwise sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于遵循健康膳食的人们格外如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if they observe a good wholesome diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}健康膳食？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good wholesome diet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:22:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是您的疗法 林纳克医生？不用草药汤剂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is your best remedy, dr. Linacre? Not infusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汗热症有很多种疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope your majesty will trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望陛下您能够相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I tell you that there are countless remedies for the sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依小人所见 近乎所有的方法中 靠用药是无救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nearly all of them, in my opinion, medically useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至不可预防？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even to ward it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说过一个有趣的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I heard of an interesting theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我相熟的一位男士曾经对我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young gentleman of my acquaintance swears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他靠运动让身体自然发汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he can combat the disease directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.35,0:22:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}战胜了汗热症\N{\fnArial\fs30}by working himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dearest wife and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场降临于我们头上的瘟疫 就是上帝的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This plague that has come upon us, is a punishment from god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.27,0:23:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都是罪人 而上帝降怒于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all sinners, and god is displeased with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.05,0:24:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的生与死都由上帝一手安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether we live or die is entirely in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们所能做的只有祈祷 祈求上帝伟大而无限的仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do is pray and appeal to his great and infinite mercy…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.31,0:24:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深刻的反省我们罪孽深重的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}and acknowledge our sinful natures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.65,0:24:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并认知自己对上帝的渴求\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our need for his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.57,0:25:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不就是个出汗的好法子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the best way of working up a sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.75,0:25:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你丈夫把它舔掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your husband to lick it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姑娘 你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.43,0:25:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 女士 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, madam I…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是觉得有些头晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just felt a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了 我… 我只是有些头晕 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… I still feel dizzy, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.93,0:26:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那种病\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.29,0:26:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我染上了出汗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've caught the sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.66,0:26:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才没有 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! No gentle child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.37,0:26:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只不过头痛 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a headache. No more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的 我的胃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not! I have… I have pains in my…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这不就是症状吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Isn't that a sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.63,0:26:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎能否认？我就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you deny it? I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.93,0:26:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你不会死的 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not going to die. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会死的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not going to die. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.15,0:26:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「近日 我可怜的女仆因患汗热症而死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My poor maid has this day caught the sweat and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此我恳求陛下 指引我该怎么做？「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your majesty, what shall I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.30,0:26:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:27:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你建议您不要接近任何染有此病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would counsel against any contact with infected persons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.83,0:27:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者与染有此病的人有接触的人 您可是贵为英格兰的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}or those who have had contact with infected persons. You are the king of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.92,0:27:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的… 但万一她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… but what if she…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.44,0:27:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一她死去该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if she dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.31,0:27:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.90,0:27:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转告她 让她立刻离开皇宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her she must quit the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.31,0:27:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同她父亲回到西佛堡 务必不得出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}she must go with her father back to hever and by all means shut herself up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会派送草药汤剂给她 帮她护身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will send her infusions to fortify herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.21,0:27:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还会写信给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will write to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.57,0:27:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后陛下呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of her majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.34,0:27:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后将会去勒德洛与我们女儿会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen will join our daughter at ludlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.29,0:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈求上帝 让她们在威尔士平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray to god they'll be safe enough in wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.74,0:28:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您呢 陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.81,0:28:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将闭门留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shut myself up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何也要避免出汗症的侵入\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep the sweat at bay with every means.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.71,0:28:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可否建议您：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then if I may advise your majesty:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.24,0:28:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侍奉您的人越少越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep as few people around you as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以减少您被传染的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}for in that way you can reduce the risk of contamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝保佑你我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我前来道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.30,0:28:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将我送走您满意了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you pleased to send me away?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你不想见我们的女儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want to see our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.88,0:28:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我送走 您就可以和她一起了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sending me away so that you can be with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说安-博林女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you mean lady anne boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.28,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我说的就是安-博林女士 您毫无避讳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I mean lady anne boleyn. You make no secret of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.83,0:29:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的 她会回到西佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No she's going back to hever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的一个女仆已经死于汗热症\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of her maid's died of the sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.95,0:29:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您对汗热症的恐惧胜过了您对情妇的痴迷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your fear of the sweat is greater than your infatuation with your mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 她不是我的情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, she is not my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有和她发生过关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not sleep with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.45,0:29:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少在你我依旧被婚姻所束缚之时 是不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not whilst you and I are still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是您同她说过您爱她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you tell her that you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.65,0:29:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您对她许诺过吗？她让您对她许诺吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you make promises to her? Does she make promises to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.05,0:29:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是如您所说 我依旧是您的妻子 您不肯告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you not tell me since, as you say, I am still your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.46,0:29:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 我衷心的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, I wish with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.74,0:29:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要接受我们的婚姻是建立在 谎言之上这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could accept our marriage was based upon a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.35,0:29:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.51,0:29:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我依旧爱着你 期望你能保命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still love you enough to want to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.61,0:29:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 按我的吩咐去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do as I command.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.98,0:29:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去威尔士吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.81,0:29:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当您用这样的词藻 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you speak like that, my love…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.92,0:30:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的举动好像暗示我得了瘟疫 好像爱情本身就是瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you act as though I had the plague. As though love itself was like the plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.02,0:30:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会写信给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall write to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请向玛丽带上身为国王 身为人父 的我对她的热爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell mary, the king, her father, sends his love and devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.27,0:30:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.09,0:30:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel fine, papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.71,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.52,0:30:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.25,0:30:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我的女仆出事 我就一定被传染了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of my maid I'm certain to be contaminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.01,0:30:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.81,0:30:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.48,0:31:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.79,0:31:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.24,0:31:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法呼吸 停住马车 我无法呼吸 停住马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe, stop the coach. I can't breathe! Stop the coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.76,0:31:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停步 停下马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt! Ho! Stop the coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续驾车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 琼… 我亲爱的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh joan… my dear sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.27,0:33:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 众所周知 这场病灾是上帝所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, it is well said and known that sickness is a visitation from god.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.83,0:33:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是对我们罪孽的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a punishment for sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.35,0:33:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是神父 为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why father,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.23,0:33:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么我的国土成为他憎恨之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}why is my land so marked out for disfavour?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.71,0:33:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到底做了什么孽 以至万能的上帝如此的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we done that has displeased almighty god so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将这场瘟疫降临到我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he brings this pestilence upon us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:33:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我的错吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 我恳求上天原谅 这些我们不知为何的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I ask forgiveness for sins unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.75,0:34:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非以一个国王的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I beg you for your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是是一个男人的身份 恳请您为我们祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as a king, but as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.29,0:34:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求您了 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.68,0:34:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.32,0:34:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.57,0:34:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意大利 奥维多\N{\fnArial\fs30}ORBIETO. ITALY.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.33,0:35:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buon giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.74,0:35:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是英国来的访者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the english envoys?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.90,0:35:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prego. Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国来的使者 加德纳先生和福克斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inviate inglese, mr. Gardiner and mr. Foxe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sons…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.94,0:35:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父\N{\fnArial\fs30}holy father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.13,0:35:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被迫居住在如此窘迫的环境中 你们也见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see how I am forced to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们能想象到教皇的苦衷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine your father's misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西班牙人几乎将我击溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spaniards are practically.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.94,0:35:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇圣人您知道我们为何来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your holiness knows why we are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.85,0:36:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们带来一封国王亨利陛下的书信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bring a letter from his majesty, king henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰 爱尔兰和法国的国王 最忠实的天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most dutiful and catholic king of england, ireland and france.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.92,0:36:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了您能废除他的婚约 国王陛下在此提前感谢教皇圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty thanks your holiness in advance for your support of his nullity suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.48,0:36:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他知道圣父您不会拒绝他的恳求\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that you, holy father, will not object to our supplications.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我诚心的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.87,0:36:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够使你们的主子欢欣满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}to please and satisfy your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我必须跟你们坦诚相见 上帝为证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must say to you, in all honesty, as god is my witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.04,0:36:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为一个诚实的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as an honest man,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.87,0:36:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经被告诫 此请求仅仅出于 国王本人对安-博林这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have been advised that this suit is prompted solely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.78,0:36:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盲目而不正当的爱慕而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the king's vain affection and undue love for this woman, anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我听闻 英国国王只因「私人理由」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been said to me that the king of england desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.71,0:36:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}擅自要求离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}his divorce for "private reasons" only,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.67,0:36:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他爱的这个女人 相比之下不仅在身份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the woman he loves is far below him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.93,0:37:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在品德方面都过于低微\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only in rank, but… also in virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.52,0:37:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇圣人… 这些都是谁跟您说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holiness… who has told you these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.13,0:37:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说那个叫安的女人已经有了身孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that anne is already pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.03,0:37:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且国王急切的希望让她的孩子 成为继承皇位的子裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the king urgently wishes to make her child his heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.30,0:37:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安女士是重视贞节的表范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady anne is a model of chastity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.76,0:37:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管她本人也期待生儿育女 但也要等待时机合适之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though very apt to procreate children, when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.27,0:37:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父大人 她为人之纯洁 珍留至今的处女之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy father, she impresses everyone who sees her or knows her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.61,0:37:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为人之冷静 娴熟和谦虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the purity of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.82,0:37:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给所有见过及认识她的人留下深刻印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}her constant virginity, her soberness, meekness, humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确在英格兰诸多女子之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}indeed of all the women in england,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.32,0:37:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前为止她是成为皇后的最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is by far the fittest to become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.46,0:37:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但凯瑟琳皇后怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what of queen katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.49,0:37:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下他希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty hopes that,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.99,0:37:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当教皇圣人您对我们所提出的法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your highness has taken cognisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}论据给予裁决之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the legal arguments we have brought with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您能写信勒令皇后顺从\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will write to the queen to urge her compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.95,0:37:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.97,0:38:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是在得出裁定之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first I must read these arguments… must I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.82,0:38:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得先过目这些论据 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before coming to judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下直接表明他的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty also made it plain to us that,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.39,0:38:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说如果您无法顺其所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could not give him satisfaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.82,0:38:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只有去别处令寻定夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he must look for a judgment elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.69,0:38:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将不得不置身于圣主教堂律条\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be forced to live outside the laws of holy church,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.74,0:38:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及教皇圣人您的掌权范围之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beyond your holiness's authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.42,0:38:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.58,0:38:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的心上人\N{\fnArial\fs30}MY SWEETHEART.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.85,0:38:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经给你送去 很多汗热症的解药 请务必服下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}*******I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.26,0:38:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侍童？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.71,0:39:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.75,0:39:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路人小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.41,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.14,0:39:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.97,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.29,0:40:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.57,0:40:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy father!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕我的答复要让你们失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you will be disappointed in my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.64,0:40:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于国王的个案 我无法在此时此地做出定夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am unable to make a judgment, here and today, concerning the king's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.28,0:40:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 我可没说此事就这样了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I have not said it is the end of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.85,0:40:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已决定尽早解决此事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am resolved it should be settled as soon as may be…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.81,0:40:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是不是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.44,0:40:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们也看到我现在的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see how I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.90,0:40:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我指派红衣主教坎佩吉罗为我的行政使节\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I am appointing cardinal campeggio as my official legate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.30,0:40:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你国的病灾有所消退 他就会去英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the sickness in your country abates, he will travel to england and,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.19,0:40:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与红衣主教沃尔西组成办事院\N{\fnArial\fs30}together with cardinal wolsey, constitute a court.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.11,0:40:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听取意见此事的益处所在 并在其基础之上做出定夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hear and decide upon the merits of the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.74,0:40:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你们的国王如你们所说的那般正直\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your king is as certain of his rightness as you say he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么此次加快他愿望成真的议事\N{\fnArial\fs30}then no doubt he will welcome the proceedings,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.43,0:41:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定会受到你们国王的欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can only hasten the fulfillments of his desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.10,0:41:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.03,0:41:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下应该知道诺福克公爵阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty should know that, his grace, the duke of norfolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.06,0:41:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经染上了出汗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}having caught the sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假借求医问诊之名要求回到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked to be allowed back to london, ostensibly to see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.84,0:41:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经代替陛下您拒绝了他的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}This permission I refused on your majesty's behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.08,0:41:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您的三个药剂师已经病倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 of your majesty's apothecaries have also fallen sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.64,0:42:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时三个侍应已经过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}while 3 of your chamber servants have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.68,0:42:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的石匠也已病逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mason redman is also dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.35,0:42:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病灾毫无减退的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disease shows no sign of abating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.60,0:42:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单单在伦敦 已有四万个病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are now 40, 000 cases in london alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.56,0:42:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安-博林女士也已染病 但尚在人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady anne boleyn is also sick, yet still survives…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.86,0:42:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}林纳克医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}dr. Linacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.40,0:42:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.51,0:42:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安女士患病 安-博林女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady anne is ill. Lady anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.88,0:42:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速去西佛堡 看在上帝怜爱的份上 救她一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go at once to hever castle. And for the love of god, save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.74,0:43:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小人之见 她已无药可救\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my opinion there is no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.66,0:43:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生存下去的希望极为渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vital signs of life are weak and worsening.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.31,0:43:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病危之际 让牧师守护在她身边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The priest should attend her now, in extremis.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.31,0:43:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.81,0:44:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不怕吗 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not frightened, papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.86,0:44:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怕什么？害怕死亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what? Of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.78,0:44:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我已经彻彻底底的将自己托付于上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I've given myself entirely into the hands of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.96,0:44:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我坚信待我死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know with certainty that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.67,0:44:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以升入比这里美好的净土\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I die I shall pass into a far better place than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.89,0:44:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的心肝 你所看到的这一切 不是对死亡的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see around you, darling heart, is not the fear of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.45,0:44:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是对死后所发生事情的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the fear of what, for the unrepentant, must surely follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.56,0:44:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起出汗症 一个缠绕住欧洲的恶灵更让我恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a spectre haunting europe which I fear far more than the sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.63,0:44:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一种四处蔓延的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sickness spreading everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.97,0:44:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将成千上万的人感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}infecting thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.72,0:44:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说得到底是什么 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what do you speak, papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.86,0:44:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是路德教这种疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disease of lutheranism.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.54,0:44:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在穷人中不停扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}It spreads among the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.01,0:44:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人认为教会富有 腐败 而颓废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who see the church as rich and corrupt and decadent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.84,0:44:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在德国挑起了农民战争 死亡人数超过十万\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has already ignited a peasants' war in germany, and killed over 100, 000 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.08,0:45:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种传染病已经蔓延到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The contagion has now spread to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.30,0:45:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勃艮第 萨尔茨保 蒙彼利埃以及南特\N{\fnArial\fs30}burgundy, salzburg, montpellier and nantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.09,0:45:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天都有这毒恶异教所传来的新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day brings more news of the virulence of this heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.64,0:45:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定它不会传到这里来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely it won't come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.55,0:45:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈 它已经传到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! It is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们获知伦敦市内有秘密会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know of secret meetings here in the city of london,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.34,0:45:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里的教堂被袭击 遗臭万年的书籍被散播\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the church is attacked, infamous books distributed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.40,0:45:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来问问你 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.31,0:45:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果房子里面有瘟疫 你会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do to a house which is plagued with sickness?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.43,0:45:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用火来消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You purge it with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.31,0:45:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.71,0:45:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同理\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the same way then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.96,0:45:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须用火来 驱逐感染我们信仰殿堂的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sickness which is in our house of faith must be purged with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.89,0:45:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 如你所知 我反对暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I am against violence, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.79,0:45:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我坚信路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe that luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.64,0:45:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及他的追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.70,0:45:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该在此时被镇压 用火焚死\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be seized, right now, and burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.40,0:47:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 众多我们身边的人已经病死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, multitudes are dying around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.66,0:47:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近期 差不多牛津 剑桥 和伦敦的人都已患病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost everyone in oxford, cambridge and london has been ill recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.16,0:47:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于主教大人也已病倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the cardinal has also been ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.98,0:47:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而陛下您离宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your majesty gone from court,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.56,0:47:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个王国处于无人统治状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is really no government of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.65,0:47:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城市内已经出现几次暴动 但是陛下您还不必为此担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been some riots in the city, but your majesty should not be alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.92,0:48:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.61,0:48:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.58,0:48:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去叫主子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.58,0:48:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主子 主子 - 爸爸 爸爸 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My lord! My lord! - Papa! Papa come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.15,0:49:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治…\N{\fnArial\fs30}George…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.55,0:49:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.78,0:49:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可知道自己做到什么 我的孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you have done, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.18,0:49:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have risen from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.59,0:49:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你又可以与国王相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can see the king again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.62,0:49:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切如以前一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be just as before!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.28,0:49:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝 我的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks be to god, my own darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.16,0:49:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从病患中得救 瘟疫也已减退\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are saved and the plague is abated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们所盼望的使节在上个周日或周一抵达巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legate which we most desire arrived at paris on sunday or monday last.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.13,0:49:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信下个周日就能听到他到达卡莱的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust by next monday to hear of his arrival in calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.34,0:49:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信不久之后 就能共享我们所期待的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I trust within a while to enjoy that which I have so longed for,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.73,0:49:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为上帝 为你我祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}to god's pleasure, and our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.08,0:49:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的挚爱 无需再为相聚很短而忧愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more to you now, my darling, for lack of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.16,0:49:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}距上次一吻之后你我分别以久\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that I would you were in my arms, or I in yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.38,0:49:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}期待你我紧紧相拥\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I think it long since I kissed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.91,0:50:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安-博林女士给你寄来一封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a letter, from lady anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.07,0:50:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我亲爱的大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My dear lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.45,0:50:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到您逃脱病魔毒爪的消息 我非常欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am delighted to hear that you have escaped the sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将会用一生的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the days of my life, I am most bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.72,0:50:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去爱戴和效忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all creatures, next to the king's grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.23,0:50:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万人之上一人之下的阁下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}to love and serve your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.24,0:50:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哀求您 请您相信 只要我上有一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beseech you never to doubt that my opinion of you will ever change,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.25,0:50:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对您的看法将永远不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I have any breath in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.57,0:50:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您卑微的仆人 安-博林「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your humble servant, anne boleyn."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.02,0:50:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来至少她还有些幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least she has a sense of humour.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.62,0:50:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安排一下 我要去沃星汉朝圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrange for my pilgrimage to walsingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.79,0:50:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便向我们这位女士道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must give thanks to our lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.41,0:53:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.63,0:53:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢您 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you god.
